    <section id="acceptance" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>1</span>Acceptance of these terms</h2>
        <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions (“Terms”) form a binding agreement between you and Nura Herbex (“Nura Herbex”, “we”, “us” or “our”). By accessing the store, creating an account or placing an order you confirm that you have read, understood and accepted these Terms together with our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="/shipping-policy">Shipping Policy</a>, <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Returns Policy</a> and <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.</p>
        <p>If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, please do not use the store. We may update these Terms from time to time; the “Last updated” date above shows the current version, and continued use after a change means you accept the revised Terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="eligibility" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>2</span>Eligibility &amp; your account</h2>
        <ul class="pl-list">
            <li>You must be at least 18 years old, or use the store under the supervision of a parent or guardian, and be capable of entering into a legally binding contract under Indian law.</li>
            <li>You agree to provide accurate, current and complete information at checkout and when creating an account, and to keep it up to date.</li>
            <li>You are responsible for keeping your login details and one-time passwords confidential and for all activity under your account. Tell us immediately if you suspect unauthorised use.</li>
            <li>We may suspend or close accounts that provide false information, abuse promotions, or are used in breach of these Terms.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="products" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>3</span>Products &amp; descriptions</h2>
        <p>Nura Herbex products, including STAMIX and GUT 365, are botanical nutritional supplements formulated on Ayurvedic principles and manufactured in licensed, GMP-compliant facilities. We take care to describe our products accurately, but:</p>
        <ul class="pl-list">
            <li>Product images, colours and packaging are illustrative and may vary slightly between production batches.</li>
            <li>Ingredient lists, directions and pack information shown on a product page are for convenience — the label on the pack you receive is the final reference.</li>
            <li>Products are dietary supplements. They are not medicines and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. Please read our <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> before use.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="orders" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>4</span>Orders, pricing &amp; payment</h2>
        <p>An order is an offer to buy. A contract is formed only when we confirm the order by email, SMS or in your account and dispatch begins.</p>
        <ul class="pl-list">
            <li><strong>Prices</strong> are shown in Indian Rupees (₹) and include applicable taxes unless stated otherwise. Delivery charges, if any, are shown before you pay.</li>
            <li><strong>Pricing errors.</strong> If a product is listed at an obviously incorrect price or becomes unavailable, we may cancel the order. Any amount you have paid will be refunded in full to the original payment method.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment.</strong> We accept UPI, cards, net banking and wallets through our payment partner. Payment details are entered on the partner’s secure page and are never stored on our servers.</li>
            <li><strong>Offers &amp; coupons.</strong> Promotional codes are single-use unless stated, cannot be exchanged for cash, and may be withdrawn or modified without notice. We may refuse offers that appear to be abused.</li>
            <li><strong>Cancellation.</strong> You can request cancellation before the order is dispatched by contacting our care team. After dispatch, our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Returns Policy</a> applies.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="delivery" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>5</span>Delivery, guarantee &amp; refunds</h2>
        <p>Delivery timelines, charges and tracking are explained in our <a href="/shipping-policy">Shipping Policy</a>. Purchases are covered by our 60-Day Empty-Jar Guarantee and the replacement rules for damaged or incorrect items described in the <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Returns Policy</a>. Those policies form part of these Terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="conduct" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>6</span>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to misuse the store. In particular, you must not:</p>
        <ul class="pl-list">
            <li>use the site for any unlawful, fraudulent or harmful purpose;</li>
            <li>attempt to gain unauthorised access to our systems, accounts or data, or interfere with the security or performance of the site;</li>
            <li>use bots, scrapers or automated tools to harvest content or place orders in bulk;</li>
            <li>post reviews or other content that is false, defamatory, infringing, abusive or that you do not have the right to share; or</li>
            <li>resell products purchased from us in a way that misrepresents their origin, batch or condition.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="reviews" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>7</span>Reviews &amp; user content</h2>
        <p>When you submit a review, photo or other content you confirm it is truthful and your own, and you grant Nura Herbex a non-exclusive, royalty-free licence to display, reproduce and moderate it on our channels. We may edit for length or clarity, and may decline or remove content that breaches these Terms. Reviews reflect individual experiences and are not a guarantee of results.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="ip" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>8</span>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>All content on the store — including the Nura Herbex name and logo, product names, formulations, text, graphics, photography, videos and software — is owned by or licensed to Nura Herbex and protected by Indian and international intellectual property laws. You may view and print pages for personal, non-commercial use. Any other use requires our prior written permission.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="liability" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>9</span>Disclaimers &amp; limitation of liability</h2>
        <div class="pl-note"><Icon Name="Info" Size="18" /><p>These statements have not been evaluated by FSSAI. Our products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. Results vary from person to person.</p></div>
        <p>The store and its content are provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. To the fullest extent permitted by law, Nura Herbex is not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential loss arising from your use of the store or products, and our total liability for any claim relating to an order is limited to the amount you paid for the product concerned. Nothing in these Terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded under applicable law, including your statutory rights as a consumer.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="law" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>10</span>Governing law &amp; disputes</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. We encourage you to contact our care team first so we can resolve any concern quickly. Subject to your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019, the courts at Chennai, Tamil Nadu shall have jurisdiction over any dispute that cannot be resolved amicably.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="pl-sec">
        <h2><span>11</span>Contact &amp; grievances</h2>
        <p>In line with the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, you may raise a complaint with our Grievance Officer at <a href="mailto:@SiteConfig.ContactEmail">@SiteConfig.ContactEmail</a> or by writing to <em>@SiteConfig.ContactAddress</em>. We acknowledge complaints within 48 hours and aim to resolve them within one month.</p>
    </section>
</PolicyPage>

